\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Derivation of \textit  {utilizRede}. \textit  {Left:} Distribution of \texttt  {Util\_Decimal} with tertile boundaries at $p_{33}=0.39$ and $p_{67}=0.59$. \textit  {Centre:} Class counts after tertile discretization; the \textit  {baixo} class remains dominant (51.1\%) due to value concentration at 0.39. \textit  {Right:} Boxplots of \texttt  {Util\_Decimal} by class, confirming clear separation of medians despite overlapping tails.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
